# Agents

`AgentDefinition` (`src/agents/types.ts`): `id` (lowercase), `name`, `description`, `systemPrompt`, `tools[]`, `executeTool`. Register in `registry.ts` and re-export from `index.ts`.

- Worker tools: implement in `executeTool`. Host tools: set `host: true`; harness calls `executeHostTool` (editor `noteBlocks.ts`). Do not implement host tools inside `executeTool`.
- Bro (`bro.ts`) is the general agent: host note tools + wiki/fetch + reuses `safeEvaluate` / `fetchWeather` / `formatTime`. Keep specialized agents thin.
- Gemini planning is JSON-only (`gemini.ts`). `MAX_ITERATIONS` is 10 in `harness.ts`.
- Trigger: `@` → `AgentPicker` / `agentMention` node. Streaming writes `agentOutput` (locked). API key from `keyStore`; CLI twin is `cli/gemini.mjs`.
- Adding an agent: follow `.cursor/skills/add-agent/SKILL.md`.
